62:- Stateful game servers with orchestration (Kubernetes/Agones or VM fleet).
63:- NAT, loss/jitter, and abuse must be handled.
95:  C->>CTRL: POST /v1/matchmaking/tickets
111:  GS->>CTRL: POST /v1/matches/match_id/results
