124:- **Auth & sessions**: validates player identity (OIDC/first-party), issues session tokens.
127:- **Allocation**: selects/starts servers via orchestrator; mints join tokens.
129:- **Ops API**: drain region, quarantine builds, kick/requeue, inspect match metadata.
133:- High-QPS matchmaking uses in-memory queues per worker and persists ticket/session state transitions to Postgres; workers coordinate with Postgres row locks and idempotency keys.
143:- Orchestrator (Agones/K8s or VM fleet manager) handles lifecycle: allocate, scale, drain, health.
148:- Game servers validate tokens offline via signature key(s) distributed via config/secret rotation.
154:- Metrics/logs/traces: standard regional stack (Prometheus/OTel/managed equivalents).
165:  - drop non-critical telemetry/events under pressure
174:- Snapshot/delta replication with client-acknowledged baselines.
253:- Versioned paths (`/v1/...`), strict auth, rate limits per account/device/IP.
